---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import gardenImg from "../assets/garden-wide.webp";
---

<section class="section" id="story">
  <div class="wrap story">
    <figure class="story-figure reveal">
      <Image src={gardenImg} alt="The Bonsai D'Uma Bali garden at dusk" />
      <figcaption>The gallery garden, Bali — where every tree is cultivated by hand.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 class="section-title">The D'Uma Story</h2>
      <p><strong>Bonsai D'Uma Bali is one of the premier bonsai galleries in Bali, Indonesia.</strong> Founded in 2020, it began in the front yard of our founder's home. What started as a simple admiration for the beauty and artistry of bonsai soon grew into a lifelong passion that brought greater meaning and color to our founder's life.</p>
      <p>Driven by this passion, our founder gradually expanded Bonsai D'Uma Bali — growing the collection, enlarging the gallery, and developing a trusted bonsai business. Through dedication and continuous growth, we have become proud to share our beautiful bonsai with enthusiasts beyond Indonesia.</p>
      <p>Today, Bonsai D'Uma Bali exports its carefully cultivated and selected bonsai trees to customers around the world — <strong>bringing the timeless art of bonsai from Bali to the international market.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
